#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_work_hours.field_bf_work_day__schedule_known
msgid ""
"False when the person has no working schedule: the time outside working "
"hours is then not computed."
msgstr ""
"Faux quand la personne n'a pas d'horaire de travail : le temps hors horaire "
"n'est alors pas calculé."

#. module: bf_work_hours
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_work_hours.field_bf_work_day__first_activity
